  "notes": [
    "**Decir** is highly irregular",
    "Present: stem change e→i in most forms, plus irregular \"yo\" form (digo)",
    "Preterite: completely irregular stem \"dij-\" with special endings (no \"i\" in dijeron)",
    "Imperfect: regular -ER/-IR pattern based on the infinitive stem \"dec-\"",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: irregular past participle **dicho**",
    "Future: irregular stem \"dir-\" (not \"decir-\")",
    "Condicional: irregular stem \"dir-\" + conditional endings",
    "Common usage: *decir la verdad* (to tell the truth), *decir que sí/no* (to say yes/no)",
    "Expression: *es decir* (that is to say)"
  ],
